, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids came in under 90% of normal in October to November for 39 of the 75 years in the record since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 27% of normal in September to October 2025 and 23% in October to November 2025. So far in 2026 the middle shows 21% of normal in March to April 2026. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, from 55% on grid 12485 to 67% on grid 12488.</p>"}
